 "intro_zh": "花明楼是一处低山环绕的地方，这里不仅有秀美的自然风光，还是刘少奇同志的故居。花明楼景区共占地690多亩，包括刘少奇故居、刘少奇纪念馆、刘少奇同志铜像广场、花明楼城楼、文物馆、柳叶湖和修养亭等景点。",
 "intro_en": "Huaminglou is a place surrounded by low mountains. Not only does it have beautiful natural scenery, it is also the former residence of Comrade Liu Shaoqi. The Huaming Tower Scenic Area covers a total area of ​​more than 690 acres, including Liu Shaoqi's former residence, Liu Shaoqi Memorial Hall, Comrade Liu Shaoqi Bronze Statue Square, Huaming Tower Tower, Cultural Relics Museum, Liuye Lake and Xiuyu Pavilion.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
